# No em dashes

Do not use the em dash character (`—`, U+2014) anywhere in this repo:

- Code comments and JSDoc
- Markdown / AGENTS / CLAUDE / Cursor rules
- API docs strings and i18n copy
- Commit messages and PR text you generate

## Use instead

- Hyphen / minus: `-`
- Colon: `:`
- Comma or period for a pause
- ASCII arrow when needed: `->`

## Examples

```text
Bad:  Bootstrap CORS — then ValidationPipe — then listen
Good: Bootstrap CORS - then ValidationPipe - then listen
```

If you edit existing text that contains `—`, replace it with `-` (or rephrase) in the same change.
